        <p>In which of these sentences is fathomable used correctly?</p>
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">The instruction manual was so simple that even a toddler found it fathomable.</qti-simple-choice>
