      <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">The building&apos;s architecture was so fathomable that no one understood its layout.</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">The physicist&apos;s equations were dense, but after a semester of study, they became fathomable.</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
